    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into an unstable world and channel its magical energy to restore your home. Straycloud is an action adventure game inspired by 16-bit classics,\u00a0set in a lush, eerie world, described in intricate pixel art and a haunting soundtrack.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Channel the energy of the planet and use elemental abilities to traverse the map, overcome traps, and defeat enemies through diverse gameplay mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hidden paths to find secrets and determine what has led the world to the brink of ruin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to previous areas to find how they have changed over the course of the story</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into an unstable world and channel its magical energy to restore your home. Straycloud is an action adventure game inspired by 16-bit classics,\u00a0set in a lush, eerie world, described in intricate pixel art and a haunting soundtrack.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Channel the energy of the planet and use elemental abilities to traverse the map, overcome traps, and defeat enemies through diverse gameplay mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hidden paths to find secrets and determine what has led the world to the brink of ruin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to previous areas to find how they have changed over the course of the story</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "An island in the sky, the home of a once majestic people, has fallen to earth, its magic run dry. The youngest member of this line must venture to shore in an effort to restore power to the ancient magical technology that kept the island afloat.",
